[17:40:12] INFO - Reranked documents: [{'doc': Document(id='2_3_1', metadata={'session': '3', 'id': '2_3_1', 'type': 'scene', 'scene': '1', 'tag': '', 'name': '[[Dockyard]] investigation', 'arc': '2', 'source_file': '../mha_notes/arc 2/Arc 2 Session 3.md'}, page_content='# Arc 2 - Session 3 - Scene 1:\n\n### dockyard investigation\n- ray linh overhears from the workers that there was an incident recently.\n- walter lee sneaks to the top of the crane, and is suspicious of an injured worker (johnny) talking to the union rep (wallace) spots a worker limping, and has bandages on his leg, and another worker (union rep) helping him with the work. They both seem to be talking about something, and it seems like something is off.\n- azrael vale approaches the dock in-charge: jaxson kowalski. When asked about any incidences, he claimed to have spoken to the port authorities about the thing 2 weeks back, and mentioned something about \'camera 4\' and \'container 14\' being unloaded from the \'Ocean Voyager\'. After that, everything at the dock went \'smooth as glass\'. azrael vale feels there is more to the story that jaxson kowalski seems to not remember.\n- azrael vale questions vinny doyle (the supervisor), who seems terrified. When pressured, he said that he has "not seen anything like this in 20 years of working here", and then he fainted.\n- alex strider, through is flies, sees some workers drop files in a room and leave. He snuck into that room and found a secret door with stairs leading underground. He found a lot of containers, with cargo containers 14 to 20 being in a guarded area. alex strider snuck in pretending to be a worker by stealing an ID from a locker, and saw the door password being \'4a1b3e\'. \n- ray linh goes to the security cabin. She finds the log of the shipment from the \'Ocean Voyager\' from April 25th 2390, with the following anomaly: The receiver\'s identification was missing, and the biometric scan was \'bypassed by executive order\', and the shipment log was signed by the customs clearance officer agent douglas vance, but he seems to not exist (possibly deceased). Also, vinny doyle has be ~30 mins late everyday since that day.\n- azrael vale goes to the logistics department and finds a documents and excel sheets using the password shared by alex strider, that indicates that container 14c is the abnormality, it is paid for by the \'Government Treasury Transit Fund\', and data has been purged by a high level \'Security Protocol 9\'\n- alex checks container 14c to be locked, without abnormality.\n- walter lee pretends to be a PI and talks to the union rep: wallace. jacob isn\'t sharing why he was injured, the report signed by jaxson kowalski claims 0 workplaces incidences.'), 'score': 0.4348273673272244}, {'doc': Document(id='jaxson kowalski', metadata={'type': 'npc', 'id': 'jaxson kowalski', 'structure': 'character', 'name': 'jaxson kowalski'}, page_content='# jaxson kowalski\n\n---\naliases:\n  - grip\nquirk:\nPhysical:\n---\n# Description:\n- Quirk description:\n- In-charge of the dockyard\n- cooperative guy, has a cybernetic arm\n- playful, eats chewing gum'), 'score': 0.391344630594502}, {'doc': Document(id='walter lee', metadata={'type': 'player', 'name': 'walter lee', 'id': 'walter lee', 'structure': 'character'}, page_content='# walter lee\n\n---\naliases:\n  - Wally\nquirk: Quirkless\nPhysical:\n---\n# Description:\n- Quirk description: Does not have a quirk\n- Works in the sanitation department of New Island City'), 'score': 0.391344630594502}, {'doc': Document(id='alex strider', metadata={'structure': 'character', 'type': 'player', 'id': 'alex strider', 'name': 'alex strider'}, page_content='# alex strider\n\n---\naliases:\n  - Alex\nquirk:\nPhysical:\n---\n# Description:\n- Quirk description:\n  Can summon flies, see and hear through them.\n- Professor at a university'), 'score': 0.391344630594502}, {'doc': Document(id='ray linh', metadata={'type': 'player', 'id': 'ray linh', 'structure': 'character', 'name': 'ray linh'}, page_content="# ray linh\n\n---\naliases:\n  - Ray\nquirk:\nPhysical:\n---\n# Description:\n- Quirk description:\n  Can manipulate things related to sound\n- She is a k-pop artist, and a part of ray's band\n- She lives with the other bandmates: billie and ???"), 'score': 0.391344630594502}, {'doc': Document(id='azrael vale', metadata={'structure': 'character', 'name': 'azrael vale', 'id': 'azrael vale', 'type': 'player'}, page_content='# azrael vale\n\n---\naliases:\n  - Azrael\n  - Lucifer\n  - Samael\nquirk:\nPhysical:\n---\n# Description:\n '), 'score': 0.391344630594502}, {'doc': Document(id='dockyard', metadata={'structure': 'space', 'id': 'dockyard', 'name': 'dockyard'}, page_content="# dockyard\n\n# Location\nDockyard of New Island city\n# Description\n- semi-legal place, under the control of the bertolino family\n- Sections:\n\t- Crane\n\t- Security gate with cam footage\n\t- secure transportation gate\n\t- logistics department for the gate\n\t- loading docks\n\t- supervisor's office\n\t- shipping containers\n\n### Members\n- jaxson kowalski (in-charge)\n- vinny doyle (supervisor)\n- wallace (union rep)\n- 20-25 dockyard workers (including johnny)\n- guards, logistics, etc"), 'score': 0.3814873695230496}, {'doc': Document(id='bertolino family', metadata={'id': 'bertolino family', 'structure': 'group', 'name': 'bertolino family'}, page_content='# bertolino family\n\n# Members:\n- benjamin bertolino\n- and many of his henchmen\n- luigi\n# Description:\n- One of the main 5 crime families of the world.\n- Based in Italy, but has branches everywhere.\n'), 'score': 0.34333863257074465}]
