st."), 'score': 0.3792135048990384}, {'doc': Document(id='azrael vale', metadata={'type': 'player', 'name': 'azrael vale', 'structure': 'character', 'id': 'azrael vale'}, page_content='# azrael vale\n\n---\naliases:\n  - Azrael\n  - Lucifer\n  - Samael\nquirk:\nPhysical:\n---\n# Description:\n '), 'score': 0.3412921544091346}, {'doc': Document(id='2_2_6', metadata={'source_file': '../mha_notes/arc 2/Arc 2 Session 2.md', 'arc': '2', 'type': 'scene', 'name': "Return to Bob's Diner", 'tag': '', 'session': '2', 'scene': '6', 'id': '2_2_6'}, page_content="# Arc 2 - Session 2 - Scene 6:\n\n### Return to Bob's Diner\n* benjamin bertolino's men return azrael vale and ray linh to bob's diner. benjamin bertolino has surveillance on every member of the party.\n* The diner cashier luigi works for benjamin bertolino and can provide assistance if approached with the correct code word.\n* The party is told what is happening, and azrael vale warns allister that something significant is happening.\n* The party learns of five major mafia families whose primary branches operate out of Italy:\n\t  * ambrosi family\n\t  * bertolino family\n\t  * mazzola family\n\t  * dolce family\n\t  * raineford family"), 'score': 0.3096822473303731}, {'doc': Document(id='2_3_0', metadata={'session': '3', 'name': "Bob's diner", 'arc': '2', 'tag': '', 'source_file': '../mha_notes/arc 2/Arc 2 Session 3.md', 'id': '2_3_0', 'scene': '0', 'type': 'scene'}, page_content="# Arc 2 - Session 3 - Scene 0:\n\n### Bob's diner\n- The next the party meets at the diner. luigi takes them to a hidden social club underground. It seems to be a den for the bertolino family, with about 5 people.\n- benjamin bertolino is playing chess alone, and alex strider joins him. benjamin bertolino is angry that someone stole $8M from him, and finding the culprit is important to him.\n- sofia moretti (his new accountant) enters, annoyed that she has to be here today and that the money is gone.\n- sofia moretti provides a map of the docks and is suspicious of the dock reports claiming 'everything is perfect', as a few workplace incidences are expected.\n- The party is sent to investigate the dockyard"), 'score': 0.29103133963363526}, {'doc': Document(id='bertolino family', metadata={'name': 'bertolino family', 'id': 'bertolino family', 'structure': 'group'}, page_content='# bertolino family\n\n# Members:\n- benjamin bertolino\n- and many of his henchmen\n- luigi\n# Description:\n- One of the main 5 crime families of the world.\n- Based in Italy, but has branches everywhere.\n'), 'score': 0.2787140225973358}]
